   \"pub_date\": \"2026-07-28T11:31:03Z\",\n      \"source\": \"Decrypt\",\n      \"source_name\": \"Decrypt\",\n      \"summary\": \"The Digital Currency Group-owned Zcash miner brought its first greenfield site online as it looks to lower mining costs and advance plans to become a public company.\",\n      \"corroborating_sources\": [],\n      \"reason\": \"Zcash miner Fortitude powers up Nebraska facility, eyes public listing - mining expansion story.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"rejected\": []\n}"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1785240923583}}
