ccording to the SEC, hackers stole customer assets across 16 different cryptocurrencies in the May 2021 cyberattack, with the total value reaching approximately 1.7 billion baht or roughly $53 million at the time.\n+80 \n 77 **Sources:**\n 78 - CryptoSlate: https://cryptoslate.com/how-a-crypto-exchange-secretly-hid-53m-in-stolen-crypto-to-prevent-a-bank-run-and-why-the-sec-is-finally-coming-for-its-directors/\n 79 - Bitcoin Foundation: https://bitcoinfoundation.org/news/crypto-companies-news/thai-sec-accuses-bitkub-of-concealing-51-million-hack/\n 80 \n-81 [Word Count: 1048]\n+85 [Word Count: 1102]","firstChangedLine":37},"isError":false,"timestamp":1785240973795}}
